// Global handler for any uncaught throw in a route. Since 0.7.0 the runtime
// wraps every error in one envelope — { error, status, code, details } — and
// redacts internals from 500s, so `e.message` (which can carry Rust type names
// or raw SQL) must not be echoed back. Set JWC_DEBUG_ERRORS=1 to see it locally.
//
// Validation / notFound / forbidden are returned explicitly in handlers and
// never reach here.
errorHandler (e) {
    return internalError("internal error");
}
